New in 0.15.2:
• Report a problem: your email app opens on its own, and the game answers again when you come back
• A bare field grows 1 vegetable at a time, a new one every 5 seconds. Richer soil brings more, faster
• Vegetables grow before you can cut them. Mulch, a new skill, makes them ripen faster
• Each vegetable pays more
• Skills: pinch to zoom, drag to move, and a full-screen view of the tree
